oomol/oo-mymind  1.0.3 -> 1.0.4
change_type: instructions   changelog: - Provides OOMOL-connected access to mymind through the `oo` CLI without handling raw credentials. - Supports reading and searching minds, including objects, spaces, tags, links, object content, and relevance-scored search results. - Adds creation workflows for notes, object notes, spaces, manual links, and saved URLs. - Enables organization actions such as tagging, pinning, adding objects to spaces, and updating titles, summaries, completion state, content, or space colour. - Documents safety r

